#! ia 1.0

@contract agent-composition-runtime-contract
  version "0.1.0"
  meaning
    says "Fixed first-party reads disclose bounded captured native source under current authority."
    answers "What must an explicitly selected captured read accept, return and refuse?"
  relationships
    governs @operation read-captured-source
  inputs
    REQ-RT-CAPTURED-INPUT "read-captured-source accepts only a captured path and bounded line selection through the fixed installed first-party descriptor; request data cannot select authority or executable code."
  outputs
    REQ-RT-CAPTURED-READ "read-captured-source returns exact retained source bytes with capture revision and citation, effect none and no artifacts; the complete output remains within 65536 bytes."
  failures
    REQ-RT-CAPTURED-REFUSE "read-captured-source refuses absent, expired, changed or revoked authority and changed capture, manifest, catalogue or implementation pins with IA-INSTALLED-READ-DENIED before disclosing a result."
